# Pattern Learned

Whenever you see:

* Two players
* Both play optimally
* Pick from the ends (or make alternating optimal moves)
* Need to determine the winner or maximum advantage

think of the state:

```text
dp(l, r) = maximum score difference current player can achieve
```

with the recurrence:

```text
dp(l, r) = max(
    value_left  - dp(l+1, r),
    value_right - dp(l, r-1)
)
```

This "score difference DP" is the fundamental pattern behind a large class of two-player game problems.
